Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Translate surplus descriptions into functional properties, quantities, condition, and known limitations. Distinguish verified specifications from seller assumptions, preserve ownership and handling restrictions, and identify information needed before proposing a consequential reuse.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
